WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:54.210
Die!

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:58.170
Oni Giri!

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:00.920
Beaten by mere sneak thieves...

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.520
We ain't sneak thieves...
We're pirates!

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:06.250
Yes! The chart of the Grand Line!

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:13.230
I'll never forgive him!

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:22.230
"Who is the Victor?
Devil Fruit Power Showdown!"

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:30.540
In all my life, I've never
been as mad at someone as him!

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:34.950
That bastard Shanks stole
enormous riches from me!

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:37.450
I don't know how
you two are connected,

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:40.290
but I can say whatever
I want about him!

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:46.930
--Get him! Get him! Fight!
--Don't neither of you lose!

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:47.800
The North Pole!

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:48.660
No, the South Pole!

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:49.930
<i>You still say that, huh?!</i>

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:52.800
That's right! I'll always say it!
'Cause I'm right!

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:55.800
Oh, you got guts! I'm gonna
settle this once and for all today!

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:57.140
Go ahead and try it!

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:00.470
Alright, you bastard!
I'm gonna bust you up flashily!

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:01.540
Counterattack!

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:03.110
Knock that off!

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:06.450
Who cares which is colder,
the North Pole or the South Pole?!

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:09.950
If you wanna know that badly,
go to both and find out!

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.090
Now cool it!

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.220
A ship!

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:16.020
Enemy ship to the north-northeast!

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:19.890
Alright! Get ready!
It's fightin' time!

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:22.400
Alright!
I'm gonna plunder like crazy!

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:23.700
You sure seem happy, Buggy!

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:27.870
Obviously! Enemy ships
are like treasure chests.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:31.240
It's natural for pirates
to raid 'em! Am I wrong?!

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:32.870
Well, there is some truth to that.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:34.440
You're too weak!

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:39.080
You and everyone else here
never talk seriously about treasure!

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:41.410
You don't know what it means
to be a pirate!

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:51.260
W-what's this?!

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:54.400
A-a-a treasure map!

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:57.560
I- I've never seen one before!
Awesome!

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.660
Is it sitting on
the bottom of the ocean?

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:09.640
<i>Yes! Now my life
is flashily decided!</i>

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:22.190
--Today was another easy win!
--Hey! Drink up!

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:23.660
Hey, Buggy!

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:26.990
You're not gonna party with us?
We found some neat loot!

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:31.130
I- I don't got anything special!
I don't know anything!

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.830
What're you talking about?

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:34.300
Oh, uhh...

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:42.010
You said you were gonna leave
this ship sometime.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.940
What do you plan to do?

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:45.710
I'm gonna have my own ship.

00:04:45.710 --> 00:04:49.250
I'm gonna gather a reliable
crew and then see the world.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:53.790
I'm gonna take my time.
All as a pirate, of course.

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:56.190
You always spew
that weakling crap!

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.120
Say what?!

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:00.190
I only admire your
fighting skill.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:04.270
Were you just not soft-hearted,
I might've made you my henchman.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:06.730
<i>Your henchman? Get real!</i>

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:08.470
Huh?

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:13.070
We think differently, so we should
just go in our own directions.

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:15.010
That's what pirates do.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:17.610
Talking like you're
an expert, huh?

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:21.420
But if we ever meet on the ocean,
it'll be a fight to the death.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:24.520
Yeah. That's another
thing pirates do.

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:27.390
You never make sense.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:30.890
Anyways, you said something
about loot...

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.960
Yeah, we found a Devil Fruit.

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:34.400
Devil Fruit?

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:37.730
I heard they're incarnations
of the sea devil.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:40.070
Supposedly, if you eat one,
you gain devil powers...

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:43.740
...but the sea will hate you and
take your ability to swim!

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:47.040
You'd have to be stupid
to eat something like that!

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:51.950
<i>I'd never get that treasure on
the ocean floor if I couldn't swim!</i>

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:56.610
Still, I bet it'd sell for
100 million Berries...

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.020
What?!

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:06.360
I, pirate apprentice Buggy,
will now eat this Devil Fruit!

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:08.130
Gotta love kids!

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.930
Never thinking about
consequences...

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:13.990
He ate it!

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.970
Well, Buggy?
Anything different about your body?

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.640
No... Not really...

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:21.980
Aww, it was a fake?

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:26.000
Not surprising, I've only heard
about Devil Fruits from rumors...

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:31.420
Yes! That worked flashily well!

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:34.220
What I ate this afternoon
was a fake I made!

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:36.990
Can't believe everything
went so smoothly!

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:39.990
Now to jump ship before
they find out the truth!

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:42.960
With the money from the Devil Fruit
and the treasure on the map,

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:46.430
I could form my own
pirate group right away!

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:47.740
Hey, Buggy!

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:49.600
Whatcha grinnin' about?

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:52.010
O-oh, it's you!
Don't scare me like that!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.510
What kind of look is that?

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.510
Don't steal too much food
from the kitchen;

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:58.610
the cook'll get mad!

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:00.310
Whew, that was close...

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:03.250
Oh, that reminds me!
The captain just-

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.390
--Shanks! Damn you!
--What?!

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:14.760
My... My... I'm...

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.300
What's that scrap of paper?

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:19.070
Ahh! My map!

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:21.060
H-hey, Buggy!

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:26.310
<i>W-what the-?
I can't move...</i>

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:31.210
<i>Was it true you lose
the ability to swim?! Crap!</i>

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:33.250
Hey! Buggy!
What're you doing?

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.910
You're great
at swimming!

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:39.750
Buggy!

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:42.990
<i>H-help me...</i>

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:45.980
I'll save you, Buggy!

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.010
So Shanks saved you?

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:00.940
That's not what I'm trying to say!

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:05.710
Because of him, my plan in life
was suddenly delayed 10 years!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:07.350
And then I had a revelation!

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:11.720
If underwater's no good, I'll
obtain all the treasure on land!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:15.190
...Using this Chop-Chop power.

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:22.690
<i>That's why I won't let anyone
who touches my treasure live!</i>

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.870
Let go...

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.200
...of my treasure!

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.200
Crap! He spotted me!

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:36.280
Don't think you
can escape me, Nami!

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.770
I'm going to flashily
chop you up!

00:08:55.830 --> 00:09:00.770
M-my balls... balls...

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:03.100
You're still dealing with me!

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:07.810
Something's wrong.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:10.840
The mayor's never been gone
this long before...

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:13.680
Something must be happening
in town after all!

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:17.180
There's been more cannon fire
than usual, too!

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:19.290
Alright! I'll go into town
and check it out!

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:20.720
You all stay here!

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:21.890
I'm coming too!

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:25.060
Fool!
There are pirates in town!

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:26.560
The despicable Buggy Pirates!

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:29.230
Exactly! I'm coming too!

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:31.470
What kind of citizens are we...

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.800
...if we can't even keep
our mayor safe?!

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:37.970
It's no use trying to stop us!
This is all of our own accord!

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:40.940
Fine, whatever!

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:42.600
Let's go, everyone!

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:05.170
Hey!

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:07.300
Leave that treasure
and get out of here!

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:08.540
He'll come after you again!

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.800
No!

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:12.910
Leave the treasure and go?!
Absolutely not!

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:16.410
Why should I have to leave
my own treasure behind?!

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:18.680
<i>Your treasure?!</i>

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.110
Duh!

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:22.480
I'm a thief who only steals
from pirates,

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:25.420
and I just stole from one!

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:29.320
Which means this treasure
is mine now!

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:31.660
Ah, I see!

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:34.700
Nonsense!
That's my treasure!

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.730
Do you think stealing it
makes it yours?!

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:41.700
Honestly! What kind of upbringing
did you have?!

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:45.810
A criminal, trying to lecture
another criminal? Ridiculous!

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:47.940
What?!

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:53.040
I haven't fallen so low that I need
to be corrected by pirates!

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:59.820
I hope you're ready to face
the consequences, Nami...

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:03.150
Chop-Chop...

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:07.360
...Festival!

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:13.770
Just try and help your friend,
if you can, Gum-Gum!

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:17.430
Damn, he broke into
even more parts!

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.610
What the-?

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.410
Nami!

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.840
--Give me my back my treasure!
--You wish!

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:29.550
Coochie, coochie, coo!

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:36.910
Geez, you're stubborn!

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:40.930
Knock it off!

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:44.190
<i>No, you knock it off!</i>

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:52.870
Thanks for the treasure back!

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:59.050
--Let go! Let go! That's mine!
--Let go?! This is my treasure!

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:00.640
<i>You let go!</i>

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:06.380
Die!

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:10.720
<i>I told you...
you're dealing with me!</i>

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:40.610
Consider that finishing move
a kick from the old mayor guy!

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:45.260
T-thanks, I owe you one...

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.920
Yeah, no problem!

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:51.500
--Oh yeah! The map!
--My treasure-!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:55.040
This isn't over yet, Gum-Gum!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.140
He's still alive!

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:57.640
Shut up!

00:12:57.640 --> 00:13:01.140
How dare you flashily
do this to me!

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:04.280
You'll pay for this!

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:06.840
Assemble! Chop-Chop Parts!

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:18.590
Huh?

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:23.630
Looking for these?!

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:24.960
My parts!

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.740
Way to go, thief!

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.440
S-stop!

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:34.270
Go flying, Buggy! Gum-Gum...

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:37.270
...Bazooka!

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.780
I win!

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:56.160
Hey! Captain Buggy
went flying off!

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:59.500
W-what do we do now?!

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:01.830
--Act unconscious for now!
--Good idea!

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:10.780
It's all torn up now...

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.210
Well, that's okay!

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:13.550
I can still put it on,

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:16.210
plus I sent Buggy flying,
so I'm satisfied.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.990
It's all right.
I'll fix it for you later.

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:26.390
Eh? What?

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:27.930
Nothing!

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:31.230
Hey, anyways, I split it into
two bags, so carry half of it!

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:33.530
It's too heavy for me!

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:35.070
There sure is a lot!

00:14:35.070 --> 00:14:39.740
If anything, Buggy does know
quality treasure when he sees it!

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:42.900
All this should go for no less
than 10 million Berries!

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:49.580
--Here you go.
--Eh?

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:52.720
It's the chart of the Grand Line.
Didn't you want it?

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:53.750
You're giving it to me?!

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:56.190
<i>You did save me.</i>

00:14:56.190 --> 00:14:57.620
Thanks, Nami!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:01.260
I finally got a map
of the Grand Line!

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:02.730
Hurray!

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:06.000
Oh! Does that mean you'll
join our crew now?!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:09.330
I told you I'm never going
to join a pirate crew!

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:14.470
But okay! Staying with you
guys seems profitable enough.

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:17.210
But I'm only teaming up with you,
just so you know!

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.710
Always remember that!

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:20.040
Yeah!

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:25.820
Hey! Zoro! Wake up! Zoro!

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:27.310
We're going!

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:29.920
Did we take care of everything?

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:33.760
Yeah! We also got
the map and a navigator!

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.640
No good... Out of blood...
I don't think I can walk...

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:45.940
Of course you can't! You wouldn't
be human if you two could walk!

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:47.510
Why am I included?

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:50.110
You're the most suspicious
of all!

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:52.380
Anyways, we gotta help the mayor...

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.310
Oh yeah!

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:56.420
We gotta wake up
the old mayor guy now...

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:58.020
You, there!

00:15:58.020 --> 00:15:59.690
Are you outsiders?!

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:02.320
Yeah... Who are you?

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:04.830
We're this town's citizens!

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:07.290
Did the pirates have
a falling out or something?!

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.260
If you know anything,
tell us!

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:11.770
Oh, it's just the citizens!

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:13.670
I thought they were more
of the pirates...

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:14.870
Oh, Mayor!

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:17.570
--Oh no! Say something!
--Hey! Mayor!

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:19.970
--He's out cold!
--The pirates definitely did this!

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:21.710
How horrible!

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:24.950
<i>Sorry! I kicked that
old man's ass!</i>

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:26.410
What?!

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:28.780
Hold on! You don't need
to tell them that!

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:29.680
You saw it.

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:32.290
Yeah, but you had
an actual reason-

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:38.230
Why did you guys do this
to our mayor?!

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:39.960
Don't give us your excuses!

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:43.560
Who are you?!
Are you with those pirates?!

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:45.230
<i>They're really bloodthirsty...</i>

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:48.270
<i>If we accidentally say
we're thieves or pirates...</i>

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.600
We're pirates!

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:55.880
--Just as we thought!
--Just as we thought!

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:57.280
--You idiot!
--It's the truth!

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:00.650
Pirates!
How dare you ravage our town?!

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:02.810
We won't show mercy just
'cause your kids!

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:07.480
What now? Doesn't look like
they'll hear us out...

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:10.980
Run!

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:14.260
There's no escape!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:17.250
How dare you hurt
our beloved mayor?!

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:25.240
Ugh! Why did you
make things worse?!

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.240
--This is a good town!
--Eh?!

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:31.080
Everyone's so mad,
just for the old mayor guy!

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:39.550
I think they'd get mad
at any excuse we give!

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:41.520
We're turning here!

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:43.660
H-hold on!
Don't say that so suddenly!

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:45.150
They ran into the alley!

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:51.630
Chouchou?!

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:52.960
Dog!

00:17:57.400 --> 00:18:00.340
H-hey! Move, Chouchou! Hey!

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:02.140
Those guys are bad pirates!

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:04.130
You're barking at
the wrong people!

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:09.110
--Why are you getting in the way?!
--Chouchou! Let us through!

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:13.580
Chouchou!

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:26.030
Later, dog!

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.180
That was scary!

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:38.380
We managed to escape
thanks to Chouchou!

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:40.750
Why do we have to put up
with this?!

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:44.080
Does it matter now?
We're done here anyway...

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:45.420
Maybe so, but...

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:47.220
Hey, is this your boat?!

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:48.660
It's great!

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:51.660
I don't think it's so great.

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:53.660
I stole it from some
idiot pirates.

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:57.030
That's a big mouth ya got!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:59.330
Been waitin' for ya,
thief girl!

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:02.170
Never thought you'd run
into us here, didja?!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.370
You know them?

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.610
Yeah... sort of!

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:10.110
Not sort of!
We're bound by fate!

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:14.510
So you had friends, huh?
Guess we'll hafta punish you, too!

00:19:14.510 --> 00:19:18.450
You're gonna learn how bad it is
to steal other people's stuff!

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:24.120
Hey, you! Quit ignorin' me!

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:25.150
Huh?!

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:36.300
Mayor! Are you conscious?!

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:41.970
--Thank goodness! You're all right!
--What on earth happened?!

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:45.410
What in the-?!

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:48.080
It was already like this
when we got here!

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:52.850
There were some pirates left,
but they all ran off!

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:55.490
Did you not see anything
that happened?!

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:57.190
Where are the young'uns?!

00:19:57.190 --> 00:20:00.760
Do you mean those three kids?

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:03.490
So they're alive?!

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:09.190
Those fools! How dare they
harm a senior citizen like me!

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:14.770
We just finished driving
those idiots away!

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:16.110
But it's still not enough!

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.880
They almost seemed
to be mocking us!

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:23.950
They'd never understand how we felt
when they attacked our town!

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.250
Yeah! Yeah!

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:27.290
There's still time
to go after them and catch-

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:28.920
Shut up!

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:32.090
I'm the only one who's allowed
to complain about them!

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:35.360
I won't let anyone else
talk badly about them!

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:38.230
W-what?!
Why are you protecting pirates?!

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:41.600
Damn them... So they plan
to just disappear?!

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:43.640
Where did they go?!

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:46.130
They, uhh, ran toward the port.

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:49.040
--Damn it!
--Mayor! Mayor!

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:52.450
They think they can do whatever
they please in my town!

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:56.410
I have lots to say to you all!

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:02.660
Alright! Let's get going!

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:06.430
Isn't that Buggy's mark
on your sail there?

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:09.760
<i>Well, this is his boat.
I'll get rid of it sometime!</i>

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:15.170
Hey! Wait! Young'uns!

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.690
The old mayor guy!

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:27.510
<i>I was ready to die!</i>

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:31.180
<i>I was ready to die
filled with despair!</i>

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:35.550
Thanks! We're in your debt!

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:41.630
Don't worry about it!
Take it easy!

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:45.800
<i>Damn you young'uns...
Damn you young'uns...</i>

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:48.290
<i>Damn you young'uns...</i>

00:21:50.270 --> 00:21:52.260
I have no words...

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:00.210
What?!

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:02.420
You left one
of the treasure bags?!

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:03.150
Yeah.

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:06.050
Just one is worth 5 million Berries,
you know!

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:09.590
But they need money to fix
their destroyed town, right?

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:11.830
<i>That was my treasure!</i>

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:15.230
Do you know how much I suffered
trying to steal it?!

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:16.800
Why did you do that?!

00:22:16.800 --> 00:22:20.800
--Stop! I can't swim!
--That's the whole idea!

00:22:20.800 --> 00:22:22.840
If you want it,
go back and get it then!

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:25.100
<i>I can't do that!
You go get it!</i>

00:22:25.100 --> 00:22:27.740
No! Wahh, that's dangerous!
I could die, you know!

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:29.810
Die once!

00:22:29.810 --> 00:22:32.800
Do that again and I really will
throw you into the ocean!

00:22:34.450 --> 00:22:37.350
Well, for better or worse,

00:22:37.350 --> 00:22:42.020
looks like a navigator's
joined our journey.

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:36.930
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:45.420
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:52.490
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.490 --> 00:24:02.490
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
